Notes on scope:

The source fairy tales (Grimm, Jacobs, Southey, Perrault) are in the public
domain and are not claimed here. This license covers the original authored
contributions in this project: the genre retellings and translations, the field
notes, the lesson plans, the interface design and code, and the selection and
arrangement of all of the above.
